desc = Cut the contents of your selection from the world, storing them in your clipboard to paste
noEntities.desc = Exclude entities from the cut (entities are included by default)
entitiesonly.desc = Cut only entities (no blocks)
empty.desc = Include empty blocks in the cut
keepanchors.desc = Keep anchor blocks in the cut
xMin.desc = The minimum X coordinate
yMin.desc = The minimum Y coordinate
zMin.desc = The minimum Z coordinate
xMax.desc = The maximum X coordinate
yMax.desc = The maximum Y coordinate
zMax.desc = The maximum Z coordinate
